      "content": "Hey, I need some help drafting a performance review for one of our Senior Account Executives. It's for their quarterly check-in. I want to make sure the tone is professional but constructive. They've been doing amazing with client retention and keeping accounts stable, but they've been pretty consistently late to our internal morning stand-up meetings lately. Can you help me draft a paragraph that balances the praise with that critique?",
